{"seq":2,"slug":"appwidget-android","title":"Android AppWidget 与 Jetpack Glance","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-foundations/appwidget-android","wordCount":616,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"android-appwidget-与-jetpack-glance\">Android AppWidget 与 Jetpack Glance</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Android 平台的小组件经历了两代技术演进：传统的 <code>AppWidgetProvider</code> + <code>RemoteViews</code> 方案（API 1 起可用），和现代的 Jetpack Glance 框架（基于 Compose Runtime，2022 年发布）。Glance 提供声明式语法和更好的尺寸适配能力，但两者底层都依赖系统的 <code>AppWidgetManager</code> 进行更新调度。</p>\n<p>与 <a href=\"widgetkit-ios\">iOS WidgetKit</a> 相比，Android widget 拥有更长的历史——RemoteViews 方案至今仍在大量应用中使用。新项目推荐优先使用 Glance，它在保留系统兼容性的同时提供了更现代的开发体验。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;传统方案&quot;&#10;        AWP[&quot;AppWidgetProvider&lt;br/&gt;广播接收器&quot;]&#10;        RV[&quot;RemoteViews&lt;br/&gt;远程视图&quot;]&#10;        AWM[&quot;AppWidgetManager&lt;br/&gt;系统服务&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;现代方案&quot;&#10;        GAW[&quot;GlanceAppWidget&lt;br/&gt;Compose 声明式&quot;]&#10;        PC[&quot;provideContent&lt;br/&gt;UI 入口&quot;]&#10;        GS[&quot;Glance State&lt;br/&gt;持久化状态&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;系统层&quot;&#10;        HM[&quot;Home Screen&lt;br/&gt;Launcher&quot;]&#10;        WMR[&quot;WidgetManagerService&lt;br/&gt;系统服务&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    AWP --&gt;|&quot;onUpdate 回调&quot;| RV&#10;    RV --&gt;|&quot;partiallyUpdate&quot;| AWM&#10;    GAW --&gt;|&quot;provideGlance&quot;| PC&#10;    PC --&gt;|&quot;update state&quot;| GS&#10;    GS --&gt;|&quot;触发重绘&quot;| PC&#10;    AWM --&gt; WMR&#10;    PC --&gt; WMR&#10;    WMR --&gt; HM\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph \"传统方案\"\n        AWP[\"AppWidgetProvider&lt;br/&gt;广播接收器\"]\n        RV[\"RemoteViews&lt;br/&gt;远程视图\"]\n        AWM[\"AppWidgetManager&lt;br/&gt;系统服务\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"现代方案\"\n        GAW[\"GlanceAppWidget&lt;br/&gt;Compose 声明式\"]\n        PC[\"provideContent&lt;br/&gt;UI 入口\"]\n        GS[\"Glance State&lt;br/&gt;持久化状态\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"系统层\"\n        HM[\"Home Screen&lt;br/&gt;Launcher\"]\n        WMR[\"WidgetManagerService&lt;br/&gt;系统服务\"]\n    end\n\n    AWP --&gt;|\"onUpdate 回调\"| RV\n    RV --&gt;|\"partiallyUpdate\"| AWM\n    GAW --&gt;|\"provideGlance\"| PC\n    PC --&gt;|\"update state\"| GS\n    GS --&gt;|\"触发重绘\"| PC\n    AWM --&gt; WMR\n    PC --&gt; WMR\n    WMR --&gt; HM</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"传统-appwidgetprovider\">传统 AppWidgetProvider</h2><p><code>AppWidgetProvider</code> 是一个 <code>BroadcastReceiver</code> 的子类，接收系统发出的 widget 生命周期事件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class TodoAppWidgetProvider : AppWidgetProvider() {&#10;&#10;    override fun onUpdate(&#10;        context: Context,&#10;        appWidgetManager: AppWidgetManager,&#10;        appWidgetIds: IntArray&#10;    ) {&#10;        // 每个 widget 实例都需要更新&#10;        for (appWidgetId in appWidgetIds) {&#10;            updateAppWidget(context, appWidgetManager, appWidgetId)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun onEnabled(context: Context) {&#10;        // 第一个 widget 实例被添加时调用&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun onDisabled(context: Context) {&#10;        // 最后一个 widget 实例被移除时调用&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun onDeleted(context: Context, appWidgetIds: IntArray) {&#10;        // widget 实例被移除时调用&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    companion object {&#10;        fun updateAppWidget(&#10;            context: Context,&#10;            appWidgetManager: AppWidgetManager,&#10;            appWidgetId: Int&#10;        ) {&#10;            val views = RemoteViews(context.packageName, R.layout.widget_todo)&#10;            views.setTextViewText(R.id.widget_title, &quot;今日待办&quot;)&#10;            views.setTextViewText(R.id.widget_count, &quot;5 项未完成&quot;)&#10;&#10;            // 设置点击 PendingIntent&#10;            val intent = Intent(context, MainActivity::class.java).apply {&#10;                flags = Intent.FLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK&#10;            }&#10;            val pendingIntent = PendingIntent.getActivity(&#10;                context, 0, intent,&#10;                PendingIntent.FLAG_UPDATE_CURRENT or PendingIntent.FLAG_IMMUTABLE&#10;            )&#10;            views.setOnClickPendingIntent(R.id.widget_root, pendingIntent)&#10;&#10;            appWidgetManager.updateAppWidget(appWidgetId, views)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class TodoAppWidgetProvider : AppWidgetProvider() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onUpdate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        context: Context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        appWidgetManager: AppWidgetManager,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        appWidgetIds: IntArray</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 每个 widget 实例都需要更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (appWidgetId in appWidgetIds) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            updateAppWidget(context, appWidgetManager, appWidgetId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onEnabled(context: Context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 第一个 widget 实例被添加时调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onDisabled(context: Context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 最后一个 widget 实例被移除时调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onDeleted(context: Context, appWidgetIds: IntArray) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // widget 实例被移除时调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    companion object {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fun updateAppWidget(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            context: Context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            appWidgetManager: AppWidgetManager,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            appWidgetId: Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val views = RemoteViews(context.packageName, R.layout.widget_todo)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            views.setTextViewText(R.id.widget_title, \"今日待办\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            views.setTextViewText(R.id.widget_count, \"5 项未完成\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 设置点击 PendingIntent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val intent = Intent(context, MainActivity::class.java).apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                flags = Intent.FLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val pendingIntent = PendingIntent.getActivity(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                context, 0, intent,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                PendingIntent.FLAG_UPDATE_CURRENT or PendingIntent.FLAG_IMMUTABLE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            views.setOnClickPendingIntent(R.id.widget_root, pendingIntent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            appWidgetManager.updateAppWidget(appWidgetId, views)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"remoteviews-的限制\">RemoteViews 的限制</h3><p><code>RemoteViews</code> 只支持有限的视图类型，不支持自定义 View 的直接嵌入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">支持的视图</th>\n<th align=\"left\">不支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>FrameLayout</code>, <code>LinearLayout</code>, <code>RelativeLayout</code>, <code>GridLayout</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">自定义 View 子类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>Button</code>, <code>TextView</code>, <code>ImageView</code>, <code>ProgressBar</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>RecyclerView</code>, <code>WebView</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>ListView</code>, <code>StackView</code>, <code>GridView</code>（集合视图）</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>EditText</code>, <code>SeekBar</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>ViewFlipper</code>, <code>AdapterViewFlipper</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>SurfaceView</code>, <code>TextureView</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"widget-配置声明\">Widget 配置声明</h2><p>在 <code>AndroidManifest.xml</code> 中声明 widget provider：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;receiver&#10;    android:name=&quot;.TodoAppWidgetProvider&quot;&#10;    android:exported=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;intent-filter&gt;&#10;        &lt;action android:name=&quot;android.appwidget.action.APPWIDGET_UPDATE&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/intent-filter&gt;&#10;    &lt;meta-data&#10;        android:name=&quot;android.appwidget.provider&quot;&#10;        android:resource=&quot;@xml/todo_widget_info&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/receiver&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">receiver</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".TodoAppWidgetProvider\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:exported</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.appwidget.action.APPWIDGET_UPDATE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">meta-data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.appwidget.provider\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        android:resource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@xml/todo_widget_info\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">receiver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 <code>res/xml/todo_widget_info.xml</code> 中定义 widget 元数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;utf-8&quot;?&gt;&#10;&lt;appwidget-provider xmlns:android=&quot;http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android&quot;&#10;    android:minWidth=&quot;180dp&quot;&#10;    android:minHeight=&quot;110dp&quot;&#10;    android:updatePeriodMillis=&quot;1800000&quot;&#10;    android:resizeMode=&quot;horizontal|vertical&quot;&#10;    android:widgetCategory=&quot;home_screen|keyguard&quot;&#10;    android:initialLayout=&quot;@layout/widget_todo&quot;&#10;    android:previewLayout=&quot;@layout/widget_todo_preview&quot;&#10;    android:description=&quot;@string/widget_description&quot;&#10;    android:targetCellWidth=&quot;3&quot;&#10;    android:targetCellHeight=&quot;2&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;?</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">xml</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encoding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"utf-8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">?></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">appwidget-provider</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xmlns:android</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:minWidth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"180dp\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:minHeight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"110dp\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:updatePeriodMillis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1800000\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:resizeMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"horizontal|vertical\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:widgetCategory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"home_screen|keyguard\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:initialLayout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@layout/widget_todo\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:previewLayout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@layout/widget_todo_preview\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@string/widget_description\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:targetCellWidth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:targetCellHeight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"关键属性说明\">关键属性说明</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">属性</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>minWidth</code> / <code>minHeight</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">widget 最小尺寸（dp）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>updatePeriodMillis</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">自动更新周期，最小 30 分钟（1800000ms）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>resizeMode</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">可调整方向：<code>none</code>, <code>horizontal</code>, <code>vertical</code>, <code>horizontal|vertical</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>widgetCategory</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">显示位置：<code>home_screen</code>, <code>keyguard</code>（锁屏）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>targetCellWidth</code> / <code>targetCellHeight</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Android 12+，指定默认占用的网格单元格数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"jetpack-glance-现代方案\">Jetpack Glance 现代方案</h2><p>Glance 是基于 Compose Runtime 的声明式 widget 框架，用 Kotlin 编写，提供类型安全的 UI 构建方式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"依赖配置\">依赖配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts&#10;dependencies {&#10;    implementation(&quot;androidx.glance:glance-appwidget:1.1.1&quot;)&#10;    implementation(&quot;androidx.glance:glance-material3:1.1.1&quot;)&#10;    implementation(&quot;androidx.glance:glance-appwidget-proto:1.1.1&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(\"androidx.glance:glance-appwidget:1.1.1\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(\"androidx.glance:glance-material3:1.1.1\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(\"androidx.glance:glance-appwidget-proto:1.1.1\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"定义-glanceappwidget\">定义 GlanceAppWidget</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class TodoGlanceWidget : GlanceAppWidget(&#10;    sizeMode = SizeMode.Responsive(&#10;        sizes = setOf(&#10;            DpSize(180.dp, 110.dp),   // 小尺寸&#10;            DpSize(270.dp, 200.dp),   // 中尺寸&#10;            DpSize(400.dp, 300.dp)    // 大尺寸&#10;        )&#10;    )&#10;) {&#10;    override suspend fun provideGlance(context: Context, id: GlanceId) {&#10;        // 加载初始状态&#10;        val todos = TodoRepository.getTopTodos(5)&#10;&#10;        provideContent {&#10;            TodoWidgetContent(todos)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun TodoWidgetContent(todos: List&lt;TodoItem&gt;) {&#10;    Column(&#10;        modifier = GlanceModifier&#10;            .fillMaxSize()&#10;            .background(GlanceTheme.colors.surface)&#10;            .padding(16.dp)&#10;    ) {&#10;        Text(&#10;            text = &quot;今日待办&quot;,&#10;            style = TextStyle(&#10;                fontSize = 14.sp,&#10;                fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,&#10;                color = GlanceTheme.colors.onSurface&#10;            )&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        Spacer(modifier = GlanceModifier.height(8.dp))&#10;&#10;        todos.take(4).forEach { item -&gt;&#10;            Row(&#10;                modifier = GlanceModifier&#10;                    .fillMaxWidth()&#10;                    .padding(vertical = 4.dp),&#10;                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically&#10;            ) {&#10;                Checkbox(&#10;                    checked = item.isComplete,&#10;                    onCheckedChange = null  // 非交互 widget&#10;                )&#10;                Spacer(modifier = GlanceModifier.width(8.dp))&#10;                Text(&#10;                    text = item.title,&#10;                    style = TextStyle(&#10;                        fontSize = 13.sp,&#10;                        color = GlanceTheme.colors.onSurfaceVariant&#10;                    ),&#10;                    maxLines = 1&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class TodoGlanceWidget : GlanceAppWidget(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sizeMode = SizeMode.Responsive(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sizes = setOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            DpSize(180.dp, 110.dp),   // 小尺寸</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            DpSize(270.dp, 200.dp),   // 中尺寸</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            DpSize(400.dp, 300.dp)    // 大尺寸</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun provideGlance(context: Context, id: GlanceId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 加载初始状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val todos = TodoRepository.getTopTodos(5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        provideContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            TodoWidgetContent(todos)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun TodoWidgetContent(todos: List&#x3C;TodoItem>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Column(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = GlanceModifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fillMaxSize()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .background(GlanceTheme.colors.surface)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .padding(16.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            text = \"今日待办\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            style = TextStyle(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                fontSize = 14.sp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                color = GlanceTheme.colors.onSurface</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Spacer(modifier = GlanceModifier.height(8.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        todos.take(4).forEach { item -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Row(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                modifier = GlanceModifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .padding(vertical = 4.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Checkbox(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    checked = item.isComplete,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    onCheckedChange = null  // 非交互 widget</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Spacer(modifier = GlanceModifier.width(8.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    text = item.title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    style = TextStyle(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        fontSize = 13.sp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        color = GlanceTheme.colors.onSurfaceVariant</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    maxLines = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sizemode-尺寸模式\">SizeMode 尺寸模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">模式</th>\n<th align=\"left\">行为</th>\n<th align=\"left\">适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>SizeMode.Single</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">单一固定布局</td>\n<td align=\"left\">非可调整 widget</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>SizeMode.Exact</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">为每个精确尺寸提供独立布局</td>\n<td align=\"left\">需要像素级精确适配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>SizeMode.Responsive</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">定义断点尺寸，自动选择最接近的</td>\n<td align=\"left\">大多数可调整 widget（推荐）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 <code>provideContent</code> 中通过 <code>LocalSize.current</code> 获取当前尺寸：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"provideContent {&#10;    val size = LocalSize.current&#10;    if (size.width &lt; 200.dp) {&#10;        CompactTodoView(todos)&#10;    } else {&#10;        ExpandedTodoView(todos)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>provideContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val size = LocalSize.current</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (size.width &#x3C; 200.dp) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        CompactTodoView(todos)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ExpandedTodoView(todos)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"状态管理与更新\">状态管理与更新</h2><p>Glance 提供了 per-GlanceId 的持久化状态机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Serializable&#10;data class WidgetState(&#10;    val todos: List&lt;TodoItem&gt;,&#10;    val lastUpdated: Long&#10;)&#10;&#10;class TodoGlanceWidget : GlanceAppWidget() {&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun provideGlance(context: Context, id: GlanceId) {&#10;        // 读取持久化状态&#10;        val currentState = currentState&lt;WidgetState&gt;() ?: loadInitialState()&#10;&#10;        provideContent {&#10;            val state = currentState&lt;WidgetState&gt;()&#10;            TodoWidgetContent(state.todos)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 从应用的其他部分触发更新&#10;suspend fun updateWidget(context: Context, newTodos: List&lt;TodoItem&gt;) {&#10;    val newState = WidgetState(&#10;        todos = newTodos,&#10;        lastUpdated = System.currentTimeMillis()&#10;    )&#10;    TodoGlanceWidget().update(context, newState)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class WidgetState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val todos: List&#x3C;TodoItem>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val lastUpdated: Long</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class TodoGlanceWidget : GlanceAppWidget() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun provideGlance(context: Context, id: GlanceId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 读取持久化状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val currentState = currentState&#x3C;WidgetState>() ?: loadInitialState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        provideContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val state = currentState&#x3C;WidgetState>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            TodoWidgetContent(state.todos)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 从应用的其他部分触发更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun updateWidget(context: Context, newTodos: List&#x3C;TodoItem>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val newState = WidgetState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        todos = newTodos,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lastUpdated = System.currentTimeMillis()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    TodoGlanceWidget().update(context, newState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"触发更新的方式\">触发更新的方式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">方式</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>update(context, state)</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">更新指定 GlanceId 的状态并重绘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>updateAll(context, state)</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">更新所有实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>updatePeriodMillis</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">系统定时触发（最小 30 分钟）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>WorkManager</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">灵活的后台调度更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>AppWidgetManager.partiallyUpdateAppWidget</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">局部更新 RemoteViews（传统方案）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"集合-widget-listview\">集合 widget（ListView）</h2><p>传统方案中，显示列表需要 <code>RemoteViewsService</code> + <code>RemoteViewsFactory</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class TodoWidgetService : RemoteViewsService() {&#10;    override fun onGetViewFactory(intent: Intent): RemoteViewsFactory {&#10;        return TodoViewsFactory(this.applicationContext, intent)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class TodoViewsFactory(&#10;    private val context: Context,&#10;    intent: Intent&#10;) : RemoteViewsService.RemoteViewsFactory {&#10;&#10;    private val appWidgetId = intent.getIntExtra(&#10;        AppWidgetManager.EXTRA_APPWIDGET_ID,&#10;        AppWidgetManager.INVALID_APPWIDGET_ID&#10;    )&#10;    private var items: List&lt;TodoItem&gt; = emptyList()&#10;&#10;    override fun onCreate() {&#10;        items = TodoRepository.getTopTodos(10)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun onDataSetChanged() {&#10;        items = TodoRepository.getTopTodos(10)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun getViewAt(position: Int): RemoteViews {&#10;        val item = items[position]&#10;        val views = RemoteViews(context.packageName, R.layout.widget_list_item)&#10;        views.setTextViewText(R.id.item_title, item.title)&#10;        views.setImageViewResource(&#10;            R.id.item_icon,&#10;            if (item.isComplete) R.drawable.ic_check else R.drawable.ic_uncheck&#10;        )&#10;        return views&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun getCount() = items.size&#10;    override fun getViewTypeCount() = 1&#10;    override fun getItemId(position: Int) = position.toLong()&#10;    override fun hasStableIds() = true&#10;    override fun onDestroy() {}&#10;    override fun getLoadingView(): RemoteViews? = null&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class TodoWidgetService : RemoteViewsService() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onGetViewFactory(intent: Intent): RemoteViewsFactory {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return TodoViewsFactory(this.applicationContext, intent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class TodoViewsFactory(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val context: Context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    intent: Intent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : RemoteViewsService.RemoteViewsFactory {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val appWidgetId = intent.getIntExtra(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AppWidgetManager.EXTRA_APPWIDGET_ID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AppWidgetManager.INVALID_APPWIDGET_ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var items: List&#x3C;TodoItem> = emptyList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        items = TodoRepository.getTopTodos(10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onDataSetChanged() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        items = TodoRepository.getTopTodos(10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getViewAt(position: Int): RemoteViews {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val item = items[position]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val views = RemoteViews(context.packageName, R.layout.widget_list_item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        views.setTextViewText(R.id.item_title, item.title)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        views.setImageViewResource(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            R.id.item_icon,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (item.isComplete) R.drawable.ic_check else R.drawable.ic_uncheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return views</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getCount() = items.size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getViewTypeCount() = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getItemId(position: Int) = position.toLong()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun hasStableIds() = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onDestroy() {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getLoadingView(): RemoteViews? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Android widget 有两代方案：传统 <code>AppWidgetProvider</code> + <code>RemoteViews</code>，现代 <code>Jetpack Glance</code></li>\n<li><code>RemoteViews</code> 只支持有限的视图类型，自定义 View 需要通过 <code>drawBitmap</code> 等方式变通</li>\n<li><code>updatePeriodMillis</code> 最小间隔为 30 分钟，更频繁的更新需要 <code>WorkManager</code> 或推送触发</li>\n<li>Glance 提供声明式 Compose 语法、<code>SizeMode.Responsive</code> 尺寸适配和 per-GlanceId 状态持久化</li>\n<li>集合 widget（列表）在传统方案中通过 <code>RemoteViewsService</code> + <code>RemoteViewsFactory</code> 实现</li>\n<li><code>resizeMode</code> 控制 widget 是否可调整大小，<code>widgetCategory</code> 控制显示位置</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关内容请参阅 <a href=\"widgetkit-ios\">iOS WidgetKit 开发</a> 和 <a href=\"widget-lifecycle\">小组件生命周期与刷新</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Android AppWidget 与 Jetpack Glance","id":"android-appwidget-与-jetpack-glance"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"传统 AppWidgetProvider","id":"传统-appwidgetprovider"},{"level":3,"text":"RemoteViews 的限制","id":"remoteviews-的限制"},{"level":2,"text":"Widget 配置声明","id":"widget-配置声明"},{"level":3,"text":"关键属性说明","id":"关键属性说明"},{"level":2,"text":"Jetpack Glance 现代方案","id":"jetpack-glance-现代方案"},{"level":3,"text":"依赖配置","id":"依赖配置"},{"level":3,"text":"定义 GlanceAppWidget","id":"定义-glanceappwidget"},{"level":3,"text":"SizeMode 尺寸模式","id":"sizemode-尺寸模式"},{"level":2,"text":"状态管理与更新","id":"状态管理与更新"},{"level":3,"text":"触发更新的方式","id":"触发更新的方式"},{"level":2,"text":"集合 widget（ListView）","id":"集合-widget-listview"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"iOS WidgetKit 小组件开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-foundations/widgetkit-ios"},"next":{"title":"小组件生命周期与刷新机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-foundations/widget-lifecycle"}}